WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
A good price is not enough. You need the right listing.

00:10.000 --> 00:20.000
Relevance puts useful listings first.

00:20.000 --> 00:30.000
Confidence is an indicator, never a guarantee.

00:30.000 --> 00:40.000
Compare up to four opportunities.

00:40.000 --> 00:50.000
Check photos, seller, price and reference.

00:50.000 --> 01:00.000
Decide using your own criteria.
